#: ../../tools/mgi_tools.rst:32 28fa19491eab44ebab95523f4151a302
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed information about a mouse gene from MGI "
"(Mouse Genome Informatics) by its MGI identifier. Returns gene symbol, "
"full name, species info, gene synopsis (curated and automated), synonyms,"
" genomic location (GRCm39 assembly), SO term, and cross-references to "
"UniProt, NCBI, Ensembl, etc. Powered by the Alliance of Genome Resources "
"API which integrates MGI curated data. Example: 'MGI:98834' returns Trp53"
" (transformation related protein 53) details."
msgstr ""

