#: ../../tools/mgi_tools.rst:36 00a1f57cb10b4470920efa547279908c
msgid ""
"``gene_id`` (string) (required) MGI gene identifier with 'MGI:' prefix. "
"Examples: 'MGI:98834' (Trp53/p53), 'MGI:104537' (Brca1), 'MGI:96677' "
"(Kit), 'MGI:88039' (Apoe), 'MGI:88276' (Braf)."
msgstr ""

