#: ../../tools/mgi_tools.rst:92 ddce8c8122be4d7d9ef35f14eb29461b
msgid ""
"Search for mouse (Mus musculus) genes in MGI (Mouse Genome Informatics) "
"by gene symbol, name, or ..."
